=== 1. factorial via recursion (returns via stdout)
  0! = 1
  1! = 1
  2! = 2
  3! = 6
  5! = 120
  7! = 5040
  10! = 3628800
=== 2. fibonacci (return value via stdout)
  fib(0) = 0
  fib(1) = 1
  fib(5) = 5
  fib(10) = 55
